    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/56a12fe7d038cb964c7ed3c5cfb3a58f.poster.avif?t=1750177842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/56a12fe7d038cb964c7ed3c5cfb3a58f.webm?t=1750177842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/56a12fe7d038cb964c7ed3c5cfb3a58f.mp4?t=1750177842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FISHING CORNER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, idle, and interactive \u2014 cast your line and catch fish while you work or relax! Fishing Corner lives at the bottom of your screen, turning every moment into a<br>peaceful fishing break.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE REQUESTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/c8ec0caf98910711dc8ca52bc1f05aa2.poster.avif?t=1750177842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/c8ec0caf98910711dc8ca52bc1f05aa2.webm?t=1750177842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/c8ec0caf98910711dc8ca52bc1f05aa2.mp4?t=1750177842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVEL THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791030/extras/c683f0cae5c4867baaeab16e1fd66c86.poster.avif?t=1750177842\" width=800 height=450 >